# Everything below the marker is maintained by `make weave` (#239): weave owns
# the region and replaces it wholesale each compile, so a retired manifest row's
# ignore line disappears instead of lingering. Add your own entries ABOVE it —
# lines outside the markers are preserved verbatim.
#
# Note the composed entry files (AGENTS.md / CLAUDE.md / GEMINI.md) are ignored
# but their SOURCES are tracked: AGENTS.base.md is the constitution and
# AGENTS.local.md is this repo's extension, which weave composes from.
# >>> weave-generated — managed by `make weave`, do not edit >>>
